OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers help to upkeep coastal
OL,4,Awatch house
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have been helping with the
OL,7,Fupkeep of a Grade II listed coastal
OL,8,Fbuilding.
OL,10,FCullercoats Watch House opened in 1879
OL,11,Fas the home of the local volunteer life
OL,12,Fbrigade and is now a community hub. It
OL,13,Fhas been shut since May while interior
OL,14,Frenovations are completed by the
OL,15,Fcharity which runs it.
OL,17,FHowever, the exterior of the building
OL,18,Fhas still needed to be looked after,
OL,19,Fand volunteers joined the charity on
OL,20,FFriday to help with the annual job of
OL,21,Foiling its paintwork.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
